WEBVTT

00:02:59.246 --> 00:03:02.163
we can see, for example,
in your first molar --

00:03:02.204 --> 00:03:05.038
this is the one that was forming
along with your baby teeth,

00:03:05.079 --> 00:03:06.996
but it's the only one you still have --

00:03:07.038 --> 00:03:09.538
and that tells us
where you were living as an infant.

00:03:09.579 --> 00:03:12.621
If we look at the wisdom tooth,
which is the last tooth to form,

00:03:12.663 --> 00:03:16.454
that enamel would have been mineralizing
just before you hit your teenage years.

00:03:16.454 --> 00:03:18.454
So we know where you're living then.

00:03:18.496 --> 00:03:20.579
If we look at your bones --

00:03:21.663 --> 00:03:24.371
and in that pause,
you just formed some new bone cells --

00:03:24.371 --> 00:03:27.121
that’s telling us what you’re eating
and what you’re doing

00:03:27.121 --> 00:03:28.954
in just about the past decade of life,

00:03:28.954 --> 00:03:31.413
so we can really track where people moved.